---
import SectionLabel from './SectionLabel.astro';
---

<section id="about" class="py-24 md:py-32 px-4 sm:px-6 section-block">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-[12rem_1fr] gap-8 md:gap-12">
    <div><SectionLabel label="About" /></div>

    <div class="stagger-group">
      <p class="stagger-item font-serif text-ink leading-[1.25] tracking-[-0.01em]"
         style="font-size:clamp(1.6rem,3.4vw,2.6rem);">
        I care about the parts people feel but rarely notice: a screen that loads
        before you doubt it, a form that <em class="text-dusk">just works</em>, code the next
        developer can read.
      </p>

      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mt-12 text-muted leading-relaxed">
        <p class="stagger-item">
          Frontend Developer with over <span class="text-ink">3 years of experience</span>
          building scalable, high-performance web and mobile applications, with a strong
          emphasis on clean, maintainable code and efficient user interactions.
        </p>
        <p class="stagger-item">
          Skilled in <span class="text-ink">React.js, TypeScript, Angular</span> and
          <span class="text-ink">Ionic</span>. Adaptable, and always keen to pick up a new
          language or framework when the problem calls for it.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
